<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose five points to 1,288.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose five points to 1,288.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,288 today from 1,283 on May 20, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals</p>
</text>
